The dispatch_ready predicate can be set via multiple actions: finalize_candidate_direct, finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation, finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation, mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready, mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready. Also there is dispatch_ready as effect of allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate? Actually allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate has effect dispatch_allocated ?candidate, not dispatch_ready. The dispatch_ready predicate is set by finalize actions and mark_*_dispatch_ready.

