finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation:
precondition: (and (candidate_clearance_established ?candidate) (route_sequence_validated ?candidate) (not (candidate_finalized ?candidate)))
effect: (candidate_finalized ?candidate) (dispatch_ready ?candidate)

Thus need clearance_established and route_sequence_validated.

finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation:
precondition: (and (compliance_validation_complete ?candidate) (not (candidate_finalized ?candidate)))
effect: (candidate_finalized ?candidate) (dispatch_ready ?candidate)

Thus need compliance_validation_complete.

mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready:
precondition: (origin_availability_locked ?origin_availability) (origin_availability_confirmed ?origin_availability) (transport_leg_assembled ?transport_leg) (transport_leg_loading_authorized ?transport_leg) (not (dispatch_ready ?origin_availability))
effect: (dispatch_ready ?origin_availability)

